# Leakage & evaluation

- `gold_labels` / planted truth: **scoring only**. Pass via `y_gold=` to runner, never into `fit_predict`.
- CV: use `CombinatorialPurgedCV` or `PurgedWalkForward` — no random KFold on time series.
- Backtests must keep `execution_lag >= 1` and realistic `cost_bps`.
- If `LeakageAuditor` would fail (`GOLD_IN_TRAIN`, `ZERO_LAG`), do not ship the change.
- New metrics belong in `harness/metrics.py` or `harness/backtest.py`, wired through `ExperimentRunner`.

```python
# ❌ BAD
model.fit(X, y_gold)

# ✅ GOOD
model.fit(X, y_weak)
report = evaluate_regimes(y_gold, pred, proba)  # eval only
```
